{
  "Follow requests with captured responses": "通过捕获的响应来跟踪请求",
  "Footer": "页脚",
  "For a UI change, follow the route adapter to its feature screen, then inspect the feature store or hook that sends the request. Reuse shared components only when their existing contract matches the interaction. Keep pure geometry in the core package and native operating-system behavior in the Rust shell.": "对于 UI 更改，请按照路由适配器到达其功能屏幕，然后检查发送请求的功能存储或挂钩。仅当共享组件的现有契约与交互匹配时才重用共享组件。在核心包中保留纯几何形状，在 Rust shell 中保留本机操作系统行为。",
  "For a bug fix, demonstrate the failing condition and its corrected result.": "对于错误修复，请演示失败情况及其更正结果。",
  "For a consistent manual backup, stop the application cleanly before copying its data directory, or use SQLite's backup facilities while it is running. A live database can have state in its WAL file. To inspect a pre-migration backup, work on a copy and preserve the original database and backups until recovery is confirmed.": "为了获得一致的手动备份，请在复制其数据目录之前彻底停止应用程序，或者在其运行时使用 SQLite 的备份工具。实时数据库可以在其 WAL 文件中拥有状态。要检查迁移前备份，请处理副本并保留原始数据库和备份，直到确认恢复为止。",
  "For a failing API request, record its method, path, status, endpoint ID, and relevant non-secret identifiers. Compare the running": "对于失败的 API 请求，记录其方法、路径、状态、端点 ID 和相关的非秘密标识符。比较跑步",
  "For a file export, choose G-code or the portable toolpath format. G-code downloads the current NC text; the toolpath choice writes a structured": "对于文件导出，请选择 G 代码或便携式刀具路径格式。 G代码下载当前NC文本；刀具路径选择写入结构化",
  "For a first API integration, follow the": "对于首次 API 集成，请遵循",
  "For a first request without client-library setup, start with the": "对于没有客户端库设置的第一个请求，请从",
  "For a general explanatory conversation, omit project and drawing. The application uses its default context. For geometry work, carry the actual selected project/drawing IDs through chat, state recovery, queue, abort, and control requests. An account switch should not silently adopt the previous account's active session.": "对于一般性解释性对话，请省略项目和绘图。应用程序使用其默认上下文。对于几何工作，通过聊天、状态恢复、队列、中止和控制请求携带实际选定的项目/图形 ID。帐户切换不应默默地采用先前帐户的活动会话。",
  "For a geometry or NC-output change, begin in": "对于几何形状或 NC 输出更改，请从",
  "For a new native artifact with a captured request, the sidecar reruns that request and compares the resulting artifact, program, and original NC. Failed or blocked results, altered artifacts, and mismatched text are rejected. A newly supplied artifact without its captured request is removed unless it is an unchanged artifact already retained on the row.": "对于具有捕获请求的新本机工件，sidecar 会重新运行该请求并比较生成的工件、程序和原始 NC。失败或阻塞的结果、更改的工件以及不匹配的文本将被拒绝。没有捕获请求的新提供的工件将被删除，除非它是已保留在行上的未更改的工件。",
  "For a project turn, also supply its real": "对于项目转向，还提供其真实的",
  "For a pull request, compare the head against its merge base and review property-level differences. A later comment does not clear a previous request-changes verdict: the reviewer must submit a subsequent approve verdict. A merged PR can fast-forward or create a merge commit according to repository ancestry; inspect the recorded merge commit instead of assuming a fixed number of parents.": "对于拉取请求，将头部与其合并基础进行比较并检查属性级别的差异。后来的评论并没有清除之前的请求更改判决：审阅者必须提交后续的批准判决。合并的 PR 可以根据存储库祖先快进或创建合并提交；检查记录的合并提交，而不是假设固定数量的父级。",
  "For a report, include the launch mode, non-secret data/migration paths, elapsed wait, current API version, exact error tag/message, and last relevant startup events. Redact launch/session/device tokens, pairing links, model keys, and signing material.": "对于报告，请包括启动模式、非秘密数据/迁移路径、已用等待时间、当前 API 版本、确切的错误标记/消息以及上次相关启动事件。编辑启动/会话/设备令牌、配对链接、模型密钥和签名材料。",
  "For a reproducible development setup, use the launch token of an isolated sidecar you control. Replace port # with its ready-event port. These are desktop-management calls; the phone token is not allowed to administer its own gateway.": "对于可重复的开发设置，请使用您控制的独立 sidecar 的启动令牌。将端口 # 替换为其就绪事件端口。这些是桌面管理调用；不允许电话令牌管理自己的网关。",
  "For a schema change, modify": "对于架构更改，请修改",
  "For a single operation, combined NC is the original text. For multiple operations, the helper joins their existing NC sections with operation comments. This helper does not re-post all sections into a single controller program. The native kernel is the route that generates ordered operations and emits one integrated program.": "对于单个操作，组合NC就是原文。对于多个操作，助手将其现有 NC 部分与操作注释连接起来。该帮助程序不会将所有部分重新发布到单个控制器程序中。本机内核是生成有序操作并发出一个集成程序的途径。",
  "For a startup error, retain the protocol message and relevant stderr events, check configuration and migrations, and inspect the data directory's accessibility. Never paste the launch bearer token or provider credential contents into diagnostic output.": "对于启动错误，保留协议消息和相关的 stderr 事件，检查配置和迁移，并检查数据目录的可访问性。切勿将启动不记名令牌或提供商凭证内容粘贴到诊断输出中。",
  "For a support report, retain the app version, connection method, non-secret gateway host/port, exact error/status, and whether the native module is present. Redact tokens, pairing links, model credentials, and private keys. Add the": "对于支持报告，请保留应用程序版本、连接方法、非秘密网关主机/端口、确切的错误/状态以及本机模块是否存在。编辑令牌、配对链接、模型凭据和私钥。添加",
  "For an ellipse with radii # and #,": "对于半径为 # 和 # 的椭圆，",
  "For an operational release, retain the exact tag/commit, workflow result, target-specific installer and update asset, checksum/signature files, and published manifest. Validate that the installed app starts its bundled sidecar and migrations and that the updater selects the intended platform asset.": "对于操作版本，保留确切的标记/提交、工作流程结果、特定于目标的安装程序和更新资产、校验和/签名文件以及已发布的清单。验证已安装的应用程序是否启动其捆绑的 sidecar 和迁移，以及更新程序是否选择了预期的平台资产。",
  "For an update, edit and validate the bundled module/manifest before restarting the target service. Keep its ID stable when it is the same extension and increase the version to identify what was loaded. To stop loading it on future initialization, remove its ID from enabled.json and restart/reinitialize. Changing the file alone does not dispose an already running worker.": "对于更新，请在重新启动目标服务之前编辑并验证捆绑的模块/清单。相同扩展名时保持其ID稳定，并增加版本以识别加载的内容。要在将来的初始化时停止加载它，请从enabled.json 中删除其ID 并重新启动/重新初始化。单独更改文件不会处置已经运行的工作程序。",
  "For application persistence, choose an existing project, a new project, or update the already saved program. Provide the program name and the required destination fields.": "对于应用程序持久性，选择现有项目、新项目或更新已保存的程序。提供程序名称和所需的目标字段。",
  "For backend changes, restart the sidecar, update the browser endpoint if its port changed, and repeat the action.": "对于后端更改，请重新启动 sidecar，更新浏览器端点（如果其端口发生更改），然后重复该操作。",
  "For calculation, continue into core. For storage, continue through the repository and": "对于计算，继续进入核心。对于存储，请继续浏览存储库并",
  "For companion work, install a native iOS build, enable the desktop gateway, and pair through its QR code. For documentation work, start Astro, open the changed route, and run the web build to catch template and prerender errors.": "对于配套工作，请安装本机 iOS 版本，启用桌面网关，并通过其二维码进行配对。对于文档工作，启动 Astro，打开更改的路线，然后运行 Web 构建以捕获模板和预渲染错误。",
  "For compiled-runtime validation,": "对于编译运行时验证，",
  "For desktop development, open a project, create or load a drawing, and inspect the CAD/CAM flow you intend to modify. Follow its route adapter into the feature screen and locate the API call and handler. For server work, use the schema, handler, service, and repository chain to identify where validation, ownership, and persistence happen.": "对于桌面开发，打开项目，创建或加载绘图，然后检查要修改的 CAD/CAM 流程。按照其路由适配器进入功能屏幕并找到 API 调用和处理程序。对于服务器工作，使用架构、处理程序、服务和存储库链来确定验证、所有权和持久性发生的位置。",
  "For deterministic integration work, use isolated SQLite directories and scripted/offline AI fixtures. For provider-specific behavior, separately exercise the configured provider with appropriate credentials. Example requests in these guides describe supported shapes; timestamps, identifiers, ports, and credentials vary per run.": "对于确定性集成工作，请使用隔离的 SQLite 目录和脚本化/离线 AI 装置。对于特定于提供程序的行为，请使用适当的凭据单独执行配置的提供程序。这些指南中的示例请求描述了支持的形状；时间戳、标识符、端口和凭据每次运行都会有所不同。",
  "For each ID it reads": "对于每个 ID，它读取",
  "For example, a missing name in project creation is rejected in": "例如，项目创建中缺少名称会被拒绝",
  "For example, a missing project name is an HTTP # business failure even though the create input type permits omission. A connection reset while creating a project is different: it leaves the client uncertain whether the write completed. Read the resource state before repeating a mutation. The SDK does not add an application-wide idempotency protocol or automatically retry every rejected call.": "例如，缺少项目名称会导致 HTTP # 业务失败，即使创建输入类型允许省略。创建项目时重置连接是不同的：它让客户端不确定写入是否完成。在重复突变之前读取资源状态。 SDK 不会添加应用程序范围的幂等性协议或自动重试每个被拒绝的调用。",
  "For extensions and teamwork, use": "对于扩展和团队合作，请使用",
  "For faster screen work, run the desktop": "为了更快地进行屏幕工作，请运行桌面",
  "For iOS,": "对于 iOS，",
  "For integration work, the": "对于集成工作，",
  "For manual entry, provide the desktop address, token, and complete certificate fingerprint through the connection form.": "对于手动输入，请通过连接表单提供桌面地址、令牌和完整的证书指纹。",
  "For native or rendered interactions, exercise the actual target runtime in addition to logic tests.": "对于本机或渲染交互，除了逻辑测试之外，还应测试实际的目标运行时。",
  "For operation and support, consult": "如需操作和支持，请咨询",
  "For persistence, verify migration behavior and data integrity using isolated databases.": "为了持久性，请使用隔离的数据库验证迁移行为和数据完整性。",
  "For shared contracts, check generated clients and affected consumers.": "对于共享合同，检查生成的客户端和受影响的消费者。",
  "For solids with an estimated vertex count above #,# and browser Worker support, the viewer queues mesh construction in a module worker. Smaller solids mesh synchronously. The mesh queue handles completion, stale jobs, worker errors, and cleanup. The threshold is an estimate used for scheduling, not a documented model-size limit.": "对于估计顶点数高于 #、# 且浏览器 Worker 支持的实体，查看器会在模块 Worker 中对网格构建进行排队。较小的实体同步网格化。网格队列处理完成、陈旧作业、工作错误和清理。阈值是用于调度的估计值，而不是记录的模型大小限制。",
  "For the filleted plate": "对于圆角板",
  "For the normal native loop, use": "对于正常的本机循环，使用",
  "For this manifest, the current derived ID is": "对于此清单，当前派生 ID 是",
  "Forbidden": "禁止",
  "Foreground checks probe with a #-second budget. Failed checks back off up to # seconds, and bringing the app forward triggers another probe. Background state is tracked separately from offline state. Tap the desktop row in phone Settings to recheck manually.": "前台检查探针的预算为 # 秒。失败的检查会后退最多 # 秒，并将应用程序向前推进会触发另一个探测。后台状态与离线状态分开跟踪。点击手机设置中的桌面行以手动重新检查。",
  "Foreign keys": "外键",
  "Foreign-key constraint failed:": "外键约束失败：",
  "Forms are": "表格有",
  "Formula": "公式",
  "Forwarded to": "转发至",
  "Four different database defaults": "四种不同的数据库默认值",
  "Fraction of the viewport kept as margin by": "视口的一部分保留为边距",
  "Fragments are kept by the operation's rules, coincident pieces become one edge, coplanar neighbours merge, and the result is validated. A result that is not a closed manifold solid throws": "片段按照操作规则保留，重合的片段成为一条边，共面的邻居合并，并且结果得到验证。不是封闭流形固体的结果抛出",
  "Français": "法国人",
  "Free-form parameters for the step. Strings are interpolated.": "步骤的自由格式参数。字符串被插值。",
  "From": "从",
  "From a drawing card, Duplicate loads its stored data and creates a new identifier. Download exports that drawing's data as JSON; it does not export an entire project. Generic drawing updates apply truthy name/data/thumbnail values and allow an explicit null description. They do not expose the repository's compare-and-swap hash parameter.": "复制从绘图卡加载其存储的数据并创建新的标识符。下载将该绘图的数据导出为 JSON；它不会导出整个项目。通用绘图更新应用真实的名称/数据/缩略图值并允许显式的空描述。它们不会公开存储库的比较和交换哈希参数。",
  "From a manufacturing job to NC and evidence: planning, cutters, voxel stock with a remaining-volume bracket, and certified collision checks.": "从制造工作到数控和证据：规划、切割机、带有剩余体积支架的体素库存以及经过认证的碰撞检查。",
