  "Frozen install, workspace typecheck/tests, sidecar/resource staging, Rust clippy/tests, and companion JavaScript checks.": "冻结安装、工作区类型检查/测试、sidecar/资源暂存、Rust 剪辑/测试以及配套的 JavaScript 检查。",
