  "GET /pulls/:number returns the request, reviews, and changes. Reviews accept comment, approve, or request-changes, with optional path/pointer. The latest non-comment verdict per reviewer controls the request-changes block. A later comment does not clear it; that reviewer must submit an updated approve verdict. The implementation has no positive approval-count requirement when no blocking verdict remains.": "GET /pulls/:number 返回请求、评论和更改。评论接受评论、批准或请求更改，并带有可选路径/指针。每个审阅者的最新非评论裁决控制请求更改块。后来的评论并没有澄清这一点；该审查者必须提交更新的批准裁决。当没有阻止判决时，实施没有积极的批准计数要求。",
